OL,3,GNEWSACounty's only windmill added to
OL,4,Aat-risk list
OL,5,
OL,6,FA county's only surviving windmill has
OL,7,Fbeen placed on Historic England's
OL,8,Fheritage at-risk register.
OL,10,FCromer Windmill in Hertfordshire sits
OL,11,Fon an historic mound dating back to the
OL,12,F13th Century, but issues with the
OL,13,Fbuilding mean the post-mill's operation
OL,14,Fand public access are now under threat.
OL,16,FThe Hertfordshire Building and
OL,17,FPreservation Trust, which owns the
OL,18,Fstructure, said the windmill was a
OL,19,F"unique and irreplaceable" historic
OL,20,Fasset for local residents, volunteers
OL,21,Fand visitors.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
